; error: 4:5: 'add' changes the length of 'xs', a 'bind' slice, which stays bound to one value, so only its items change; make a new slice with the change, as in 'fixed changed = xs.added(…) at r', or keep the slice in a 'flex' variable to change its length

task grow(bind xs: [int]@r)
    xs.add(3)
fi

task main()
    region r
    flex xs = [1, 2, ...] at r
    grow(xs)
fi
